Sheet 1 1
Title "AMR Central Gateway ESP32-S3 Carrier"
Date "2026-08-08"
Rev "1.0-prototype"
Comp "AMR IoT Platform"
Comment1 "7-18V input; RFM95W 868MHz; protected weather interfaces"
